            "description": {
              "value": "After your initial attack redirects your foe's defenses, your follow-up wrests their weapon from their grasp. Make a melee Strike with the required weapon. In addition to its other effects, this Strike gains the success and critical success effects of the Disarm action. The Strike also has the following failure effect.\n\n- **Failure:** The target is flat-footed until the end of your current turn."
